  clueName: Doc Mahers Story
  clueDescription: "\u201CThere were stories. My grandfather used to whisper them
    when he drank too much\u2014about how the first settlers promised the deep something\u2026
    or someone. I always thought it was folklore. God help us if it wasn\u2019t.\u201D"
